{"a":[29,29],"h":"<p>29.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"178\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 177.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 31.4 31.4 38.3 45.0 45.0 60.7 71.3 78.0 78.0 87.0 87.0 94.4 110.3 117.0 125.3 125.3 125.3 132.0 147.7 147.7 154.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"38.3 60.7 87.0 117.0 132.0 154.4 161.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ey mü'minler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"131\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 131.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 23.2 30.0 37.4 53.2 60.0 68.2 68.2 75.0 75.0 81.7 97.4 97.4 108.0 108.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 75.0 81.7 114.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> siz Allaha ittika ederseniz -her hususta hıyanetten sakınır takvayı iltizam ederseniz <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"157\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 157.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 36.7 43.6 43.6 51.0 51.0 66.7 66.7 75.7 75.7 87.7 104.3 104.3 114.7 121.6 121.6 134.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.7 87.7 114.7 134.3 141.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o sizin için bir fürkan yapar.- Size bir fârık tahsıs eder. Maddî, ma'nevî öyle bir fark-u imtiyaz bahşeyler ki «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"229\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 229.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 19.4 19.4 19.4 26.2 26.2 36.7 44.2 60.0 70.4 70.4 86.2 102.7 109.4 109.4 116.2 129.0 129.0 136.4 152.2 152.2 159.0 159.0 159.0 165.7 173.2 189.0 196.4 203.2 203.2 212.2 219.0 219.0\" y=\"25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"26.2 60.0 86.2 116.2 189.0 212.2\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » medlûlünce zâhir-ü bâtında hakkı nahaktan, iyiyi kötüden, temizi habisten ayırır, sizi fenalardan tefrik-u temyiz eder.</p><p>FÜRKAN, Fark-u temyiz veya fârık demek olduğu gibi sabah ma'nâsına da gelir. Netekim « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"246\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 245.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 13.6 20.3 27.0 27.0 34.6 34.6 41.3 41.3 48.7 64.6 73.6 104.3 115.6 115.6 122.3 143.3 150.0 159.0 179.3 179.3 189.7 196.6 196.6 203.3 219.0 219.0 219.0 235.6\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"20.3 64.6 73.6 84.0 84.0 115.6 122.3 150.0 159.0 189.7 203.3 235.6\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » derler ki «şöyle yapıb duruyordum tâ sabah oluncaya kadar.» Demektir. Bu ma'nâ demek olur ki: sizi zulmeti leylde parlıyan fecri sadık gibi bir fakr-u imtiyaz ile parlatır da parlatır, sıyt-ü şanınızı bir nur gibi âfaka yayar <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"188\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 188.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 37.6 44.3 51.0 57.7 57.7 57.7 84.7 84.7 93.7 93.7 105.7 105.7 112.6 130.6 130.6 138.0 138.0 138.0 144.7 156.7 156.7 163.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"51.0 64.6 64.6 112.6 144.7 163.6 171.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve seyyiatınızı tarafınızdan keffaretler, iyyice örter -ayıblarınızı Dünyada kimseye göstermez<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 106.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 37.4 45.0 54.0 54.0 61.4 61.4 68.2 68.2 75.0 81.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.4 75.0 81.7 90.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve size mağfiret eder- Âhırette de günahlarınızı mağfur kılar.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"205\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 204.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 32.3 32.3 42.7 49.4 49.4 57.0 72.7 72.7 83.3 83.3 97.4 104.3 104.3 111.7 127.4 135.7 135.7 152.3 152.3 159.0 159.0 159.0 165.7 173.3 180.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"42.7 97.4 180.0 188.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve Allah, pek büyük fadl-ü ihsan sahibidir. -Fadliyle bunları yaptığı gibi daha neler yapar.</p><p>Allahın fadlı ne büyük olduğunu bilhassa bir misal anlamak için ya Muhammed: </p>"}